## 8. Weaknesses / threat-model summary

| Area | Weakness | Bypass route (community-documented) |
|---|---|---|
| Single import (`eidolon_run`) | All API calls funnel through the loader's encrypted IAT | Hook the loader's resolved IAT, or hook at syscall level (no static IAT to hook) |
| `eidolon_run` RET-sled | Fools static analysis | Locate real entry via trampoline tracing; static vs runtime INT3 delta (0 in exe, 24k in loader) |
| HWID rotation | Key rotates per session (blocks offline decryption) | Runtime hook / emulate `eidolon::Xor`; obtain key via PEB image-base read |
| HWID sources | HID/NDIS/CPUID/MAC/username | Hook `GetAdaptersInfo` (user-mode) or `NtDeviceIoControlFile` NDIS IRP (kernel); spoof `cpuid` outputs |
| Integrity scan | Scans resolved function table | Patch `qword_4ACxxx` table in the Warden DLL (not the game DLL) |
| Kernel driver loading | Not enforced against kernel-mode cheats | `kdmapper` still undetected ("still ud") |

